target: internal/mutate/mutate.go
verify: go test ./internal/mutate/ -count=1 -run 'TestEveryDetailLineIsIndented'
expect: want exactly 6
why:    a HasPrefix check on six spaces cannot tell six from seven, so the indent width could drift and misalign every detail block against the rest of the report
--- old
		out[i] = "      " + l
--- new
		out[i] = "       " + l
